    "finish Noun Classify visual/interactivity homologation",
    "admit Verb Actions from trilingual corpus",
    "bind Semantic Cadence contextually where an Experience actually needs it",
    "admit Nice Party contextual vocabulary/accessories",
    "prototype Perspective Shift",
    "prototype Social Identity bridge on stage",
    "audit remaining Ten Kinds item-by-item"
